{
  "sections": {
    "breadcrumbs": {
      "type": "breadcrumbs",
      "settings": {
        "container": "fixed",
        "text_alignment": "start",
        "padding_top": 16,
        "padding_bottom": 20
      }
    },
    "main": {
      "type": "main-product",
      "blocks": {
        "ss_badge": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<span class=\"ss-pdp-badge\">Protection du quotidien</span>"
          }
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "title",
          "settings": {
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "ss_rating": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-rating', product: product %}"
          }
        },
        "price": {
          "type": "price",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "description": {
          "type": "description",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "variant_picker": {
          "type": "variant_picker",
          "settings": {
            "picker_type": "button",
            "swatch_type": "shopify_swatch",
            "swatch_style": "circle",
            "swatch_size": 32,
            "button_style": "normal",
            "size_title": "Size",
            "size_chart_from_page": ""
          }
        },
        "buy_buttons": {
          "type": "buy_buttons",
          "settings": {
            "show_quantity_selector": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout": false,
            "show_gift_card_recipient": false
          }
        },
        "ss_complements": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "{% render 'ss-complements', items: \"nettoyant-mousse-sensitive-moju-c-cleanser-the-c||Pour retirer ta protection le soir\", title: \"Le soir\", note: \"Retire ta protection solaire avec une mousse douce.\" %}"
          }
        },
        "ss_facts": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"ss-pdp-facts\"><div><b>Protection</b>SPF 50+</div><div><b>Fini</b>Mat, effet base de maquillage</div><div><b>Format</b>Stick 20 g, nomade</div></div>"
          }
        },
        "reassurance": {
          "type": "icon-with-text",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "vertical",
            "title_font": "body",
            "title_size": "text-base",
            "icon_1": "check",
            "heading_1": "<strong>Sélection Sunsoari</strong> : marques choisies avec exigence",
            "icon_2": "truck",
            "heading_2": "<strong>Livraison suivie</strong> en France métropolitaine",
            "icon_3": "check",
            "heading_3": "<strong>Paiement sécurisé</strong> : CB, Apple Pay, PayPal"
          }
        },
        "sticky_atc": {
          "type": "sticky-atc-bar",
          "settings": {
            "visibility": "all",
            "style": "minimalist",
            "container": "full",
            "show_atc_button": true,
            "show_dynamic_checkout_buttons": false,
            "show_quantity": true
          }
        },
        "acc_1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Composition (INCI)",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Dibutyl Adipate, Synthetic Wax, Silica, Vinyl Dimethicone/Methicone Silsesquioxane Crosspolymer, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Diethylhexyl Carbonate, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Butyloctyl Salicylate, Ethylhexyl Triazone, Polysilicone-15, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Bis-Ethylhexyloxyphenol Methoxyphenyl Triazine, Microcrystalline Wax, Cetyl Alcohol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylic/Capric Glycerides, Water, Butylene Glycol, Galactomyces Ferment Filtrate, Rice Ferment Filtrate (Sake), Glycerin, Zingiber Officinale (Ginger) Root Extract, Mentha Piperita (Peppermint) Leaf Extract, Dipropylene Glycol, Leuconostoc/Radish Root Ferment Filtrate, Diospyros Kaki Fruit Extract, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Artemisia Princeps Leaf Extract, Origanum Vulgare Leaf Extract, Chamaecyparis Obtusa Leaf Extract, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Extract, Lactobacillus/Soybean Ferment Extract, Portulaca Oleracea Extract, Cinnamomum Cassia Bark Extract, Scutellaria Baicalensis Root Extract, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Phytosterols, Ceramide NP.</p><p><em>Cette liste peut évoluer : se référer à l'emballage du produit acheté.</em></p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        },
        "acc_2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Précautions",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Ne pas rester longtemps au soleil, même avec une protection solaire. Réappliquer fréquemment pour maintenir la protection. Ne pas exposer les bébés et les jeunes enfants directement au soleil. Éviter le contact avec les yeux. En cas de réaction inhabituelle, cesser l'utilisation et consulter un médecin. Conserver à l'abri de la chaleur.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "default_open": false,
            "show_below_product_media": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "ss_badge",
        "title",
        "ss_rating",
        "price",
        "description",
        "variant_picker",
        "buy_buttons",
        "ss_complements",
